(i) SELECT * FROM Books WHERE Qty > 3;

Result will show: B_101, B_103, B_104, B_106 (all have Qty > 3; B_110 has Qty=3 which is not more than 3).

(ii) SELECT SUM(Qty * Price) AS TotalAmount FROM Books WHERE Price < 500;

Books with Price < 500: B_101 (355), B_103 (400), B_106 (260), B_110 (270).
Amounts: 5×355=1775, 4×400=1600, 4×260=1040, 3×270=810.
Total = 1775 + 1600 + 1040 + 810 = 5225.00
